{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"05dcbfd3-9f54-4d31-b8c6-c73021eaf65b","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed the concurrent lease race, SQLite partial-commit leak, retry/DLQ lifecycle, and backoff jitter bugs across all four modules:\n\n- [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158027994_baseline/models.py):\n  - Implemented `validate_transition` enforcing the allowed `JobStatus` transition graph (`PENDING -\u003e {RUNNING, DLQ}`, `RUNNING -\u003e {COMPLETED, PENDING, DLQ, RUNNING}`, terminal `COMPLETED`/`DLQ`) and raising `InvalidTransitionError` otherwise.\n  - Added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` fields to `Job` and enforced attempt bounds and status-specific lease invariants in `__post_init__`.\n- [retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158027994_baseline/retry.py):\n  - Updated `compute_backoff` to validate `attempt` (rejecting negative values and booleans), `base`, and `cap`, handle large `attempt` values without `OverflowError`, and return full-jitter exponential backoff in `[0.0, min(cap, base * 2**attempt)]` using the provided `rng` (or a fresh `random.Random()`).\n- [queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158027994_baseline/queue_store.py):\n  - Switched connections to `isolation_level=None` with explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` / `COMMIT` / `ROLLBACK` transactions across `enqueue`, `claim_next_job`, `complete_job`, `fail_job`, and `reclaim_expired_leases`.\n  - Updated `_row_to_job` to populate `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at`.\n  - Made `claim_next_job` atomically reclaim expired leases and claim at most one ready `PENDING` job.\n  - Fixed `complete_job` to verify lease ownership, run `pre_status_hook`, update status, and insert the `\"COMPLETED\"` audit row in a single atomic transaction so any error rolls back cleanly with zero partial audit rows.\n  - Implemented `fail_job` (retrying to `PENDING` with `available_at = now + backoff_seconds` or routing to `DLQ` when `attempts \u003e= max_attempts`) and `reclaim_expired_leases`.\n- [worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158027994_baseline/worker.py):\n  - Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` to compute jittered backoff via `compute_backoff` on handler exceptions and call `store.fail_job(...)`.\n  - Updated `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to wait for scheduled retries and active `RUNNING` jobs when `wait_for_retry=True`.\n\n### Verification\n- `python -m pytest -q`: `1 passed in 0.08s`.\n- Verified state transitions, large-attempt/seeded `compute_backoff`, multi-threaded `claim_next_job` exclusivity, `complete_job` rollback on `pre_status_hook` failure, `reclaim_expired_leases`, and `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` DLQ routing via an inline verification script (`ALL CHECKS PASSED`).\n","duration_seconds":94.1176888,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":54440,"output_tokens":13280,"thinking_tokens":3596,"cache_read_tokens":249519,"total_tokens":67720}}}
